              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "o tondũ Mose, mũthũkũmi wa Yeova, wameaĩe ana ma Isilaeli, o tondũ kũandĩkĩtwe ĩvukunĩ ya mĩao ya Mose, kĩthembeo kya mavia mate masũvye, ala mũndũ o na wĩva ũtaamasũvya na mũio o na wĩva wa kĩaa: na mathembea Yeova nthembo sya kũvĩvw’a ĩũlũ wakyo, na mathemba nthembo sya mũuo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.8.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.8.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
